  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES09:86c95",
   "off": 552085,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「このでかい扉も\r  いつまでもつか…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"How long will this big door hold...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES09:86cc8",
   "off": 552136,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「鉱山長の許しがあるなら\r  かまわんが…\u0010\b  あんたら正気か？」\u0010",
   "en": "\"If the mine overseer's given the say-so, fine by me...\u0010\bBut are you folks out of your minds?\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES09:86d0b",
   "off": 552203,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「人々を救ってくれて\r  ありがとう」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Thank you for saving everyone.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
